          "id": "f0fcceb1-28ab-487c-b5eb-57aef4705d93",
          "name": "BigCommerce Create a Currency",
          "request": {
            "name": "BigCommerce Create a Currency",
            "description": {
              "content": "Creates *Currency*.\n\n**Required Fields** \n\n* name\n* currency_code\n* currency_exchange_rate\n* token_location\n* token\n* decimal_token\n* thousands_token\n* decimal_places\n\n**Read-Only Fields**\n* id\n* date_created\n* date_modified\n\n\nThe `is_default` property can only be set to true. The value of `is_default` cannot be unset, only overridden. To change the storeʼs default currency in the BigCommerce control panel, please see [Managing Currencies (Help Center)](https://support.bigcommerce.com/s/article/Managing-Currencies-Beta).",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "currencies"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "description": "Permanent ID of the BigCommerce store.",
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "{{store_hash}}",
                  "key": "store_hash"
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currency_code\": \"<string>\",\n  \"currency_exchange_rate\": \"<string>\",\n  \"decimal_places\": \"<integer>\",\n  \"decimal_token\": \"<string>\",\n  \"name\": \"<string>\",\n  \"thousands_token\": \"<string>\",\n  \"token\": \"<string>\",\n  \"token_location\": \"<string>\",\n  \"is_default\": \"<boolean>\",\n  \"country_iso2\": \"<string>\",\n  \"auto_update\": \"<boolean>\",\n  \"enabled\": \"<boolean>\",\n  \"is_transactional\": \"<boolean>\"\n}",
